======================================================================
  Architecture Diagram: Phase 173 - Design an Ad Click Aggregation Pipeline
======================================================================

1. Simplest Baseline Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Writing every raw ad impression directly to relational database table.

   [Client] ──▶ [Application Server] ──▶ [Primary Datastore]


2. Scaled / Resilient Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Kafka event stream + Apache Flink tumbling window aggregator + Cassandra summary store.

                               ┌──▶ [Worker Node A] ──┬──▶ [Cache]
[Client] ──▶ [Load Balancer] ──┼──▶ [Worker Node B] ──┤
                               └──▶ [Worker Node C] ──┴──▶ [Primary DB] ──▶ [Replicas]
                                         │
                                         ▼
                                   [Event Queue] ──▶ [Async Workers]

======================================================================
